QuestGuidance.Register("en",457,{
[14593]="70035835\n1\tDefeat enemies in the Whitshaws (total: 10)\tThe forces of Isengard can be found in the Whitshaws. You should ride to the Whitshaws and defeat the enemies of Wildermore.\n2\tReturn to Ealswith\tEalswith is in Forlaw. You should return to Ealswith.\n",
[14594]="70035A49\n1\tDefeat mounted goblins on the Whitshaws plains (total: 15)\tThe plains south-east of Dunfast can be reached by speaking with Dudoc to travel there. You should travel to the plains of the Whitshaws and defeat a number of goblin-riders there.\n2\tReturn to Dudoc in Forlaw\tDudoc is in Forlaw. You should return to Dudoc.\n",
[14595]="70035A6B\n1\tDefeat pack-leaders (total: 3)\030Defeat pack-members (total: 6)\tThe Warg-infested area of the Whitshaws can be reached by speaking with Dudoc in Forlaw. You should travel to the plains of the Whitshaws and defeat Warg-packs there.\n2\tReturn to Dudoc in Forlaw\tDudoc is in Forlaw. You should return to Dudoc.\n",
[14596]="700360DB\n1\tTalk to Gyric to travel to the Whitshaws and speak with Rilbert\tGyric is waiting for your decision in Forlaw. You should speak with Gyric when you are ready to travel to the Whitshaws and talk to Rilbert to begin your trial.\n2\tDefeat a Rohirrim jouster in a duel\tRohirrim jousters can be found on the field beyond Rilbert. You have been tasked with defeating three Rohirrim jousters.\n3\tDefeat a second Rohirrim jouster in a duel\tRohirrim jousters can be found on the field beyond Rilbert. You have been tasked with defeating three Rohirrim jousters.\n4\tDefeat a third Rohirrim jouster in a duel\tRohirrim jousters can be found on the field beyond Rilbert. You have been tasked with defeating three Rohirrim jousters.\n5\tTalk to Rilbert\030Talk to Gyric in Forlaw\tRilbert is at the southern end of the ice-pools in the Whitshaws. Gyric is at Forlaw in the Fallows. Speak with either of them to receive your reward.\n",
[14597]="70035AA9\n1\tTalk to Gyric to travel to the Whitshaws and speak with Rilbert\tGyric is waiting for your decision in Forlaw. You should speak with Gyric when you are ready to travel to the Whitshaws and talk to Rilbert to begin your trial.\n2\tUse the net sack to obtain your skills\tUse the sack of nets Rilbert gave you to obtain your skills, then begin catching fish along the course.\n3\tFish Caught: (total: 30)\tFish of varying sizes can be found throughout the ice pools in the Whitshaws. You should spear as many fish as possible to gain points and complete your trial. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[14598]="70035A70\n1\tCollect Warg-tails (total: 5)\tThe Warg-infested area of the Whitshaws can be reached by speaking with Dudoc in Forlaw. You should travel to the plains of the Whitshaws and defeat Warg-packs there, collecting the tails of larger Wargs as you go.\n2\tReturn to Dudoc in Forlaw\tDudoc is in Forlaw. You should return to Dudoc.\n",
[14599]="70035C97\n1\tTalk to Gyric to travel to the Whitshaws and speak with Rilbert\tGyric is waiting for your decision in Forlaw. You should speak with Gyric when you are ready to travel to the Whitshaws and talk to Rilbert to begin your trial.\n2\tRide through the first blue gate\tRide through the first blue gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tRide through the second blue gate\tRide through the second blue gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tRide through the third blue gate\tRide through the third blue gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n5\tRide through the fourth blue gate\tRide through the fourth blue gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n6\tRide through the fifth blue gate\tRide through the fifth blue gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n7\tRide through the sixth blue gate\tRide through the sixth blue gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n8\tRide through the seventh blue gate\tRide through the seventh blue gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n9\tRide through the eighth blue gate\tRide through the eighth blue gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n10\tRide through the ninth blue gate\tRide through the ninth blue gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n11\tRide through the first red gate\tRide through the first red gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n12\tRide through the second red gate\tRide through the second red gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n13\tRide through the third red gate\tRide through the third red gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n14\tRide through the fourth red gate\tRide through the fourth red gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n15\tRide through the fifth red gate\tRide through the fifth red gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n16\tRide through the sixth red gate\tRide through the sixth red gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n17\tRide through the seventh red gate\tRide through the seventh red gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n18\tRide through the eighth red gate\tRide through the eighth red gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n19\tRide through the ninth red gate\tRide through the ninth red gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n20\tRide through the tenth red gate\tRide through the tenth red gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n21\tRide through the eleventh red gate\tRide through the eleventh red gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n22\tRide through the twelfth red gate\tRide through the twelfth red gate. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n23\tRilbert is at the south end of the ice pools in the Whitshaws. Gyric is in Forlaw. You should speak with Rilbert or Gyric regarding your performance in the race.\t\n",
[14600]="7000ED93\n1\tReclaim Warstang's pouch from a Gauradan thief\tThe Gauradan thieves can be found south-east of Zigilgund. Warstang has asked you to recover his stolen belt-pouch from the Gauredain.\n2\tBring the pouch to Warstang\030Reclaim Warstang's pouch from a Guaradan thief\tWarstang is currently residing in Zigilgund. You should return the belt-pouch to Warstang.\n",
[14601]="7005784E\n1\tDefeat wood-trolls in Grazadh-gropor\tGrazadh-gropor has long been home to foul wood-trolls. Free folk seek to forage beneath its dark canopy for roots and other necessities of life. Defeating the wood-trolls throughout the area would be a boon to those living nearby.\n2\tDefeat wood-trolls in Grazadh-gropor (total: 12)\tDefeating wood-trolls throughout Grazadh-gropor would bring help to free folk who need the roots and herbs throughout the area to survive.\n3\tCompleted\tCompleted.\n",
[14602]="7000781A\n1\tDeliver the pipeweed to Widow Froghorn\030Collect pipe-weed (quantity: see journal)\tAsphodel's pipe-weed field is located by her home, directly to the west of her wheat-field. The Widow Froghorn has asked you to harvest some of the ripe pipe-weed from her field.\n2\tDeliver Widow Froghorn's letter to Eldo Swatmidge\tEldo Swatmidge's farm is up the road to the north and east of the Widow Froghorn's farm. After collecting pipeweed for Asphodel, she handed you a note and told you to deliver it to Eldo without reading the contents.\n",
[14603]="70007819\n1\tTalk to Asphodel Froghorn at her farm\tThe Widow Froghorn's farm is west and south of Eldo Swatmidge's farm. Eldo has asked you to help out around Asphodel Froghorn's farm, taking the opportunity to put in a few good words for him.\n",
[14604]="7005AAAE\n1\tDefeat dwarf-wights in the Pit of Stonejaws (total: 10)\tThe tombs at Akhaldarâg are located in the south-west side of the Pit of Stonejaws.\n2\tTalk to Kyrstig near Akhaldarâg\tKyrstig is scouting outside Akhaldarâg.\n",
[14605]="7006260F\n1\tDefeat Wights (total: 12)\tCoel has asked you to defeat wights in the ruins along the Greenway. Wights can be found in Dol Ernil and Gond Orchal, in north-eastern Cardolan.\n2\tReturn to Coel\tYou should let Coel know that you have defeated many wights. Coel is in the caravan, south of Andrath in northern Cardolan.\n",
[14606]="7003EB02\n1\tDefeat lynx upon the High Moor (total: 6)\tLynx dwell upon the High Moor in the Trollshaws. Canaddal has asked you to cull the number of lynx, securing safe travel through the High Moor once again.\n2\tTalk to Canaddal\tCanaddal is encamped on the High Moor in the Trollshaws. You should return to Canaddal and tell him that you have done as he asked.\n",
[14607]="7002BFDB\n1\tDefeat wild cats in the Brown Lands (total: 10)\tWild cats can be found throughout the Brown Lands. Twiga asked you to cull the numbers of the wild cats which roam the Brown Lands, perhaps impressing the fear of Men upon them.\n2\tTalk to Twiga at Etheburg in the Brown Lands\tTwiga is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands. You should return to Twiga with a report of your deeds.\n",
[14608]="7003520A\n1\tDefeat frost-touched Huorns (total: 6)\tFrost-touched Huorns can be found throughout northern Balewood. You must defeat Huorns of the Balewood to protect its inhabitants from their tumultuous rampages.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many Huorns of the Balewood, and in doing so, have freed the Ents from their tumultuous rampaging.\n",
[14609]="70030D59\n1\tPlace your lasso around the neck of a wild horse\tThe wild horses can be found at the base of the cliff south-west of Cliving. Gladsnel asked you to catch a wild horse and bring it back to Cliving.\n2\tTalk to Gladsnel\tGladsnel is in Cliving. Gladsnel will be pleased to hear that you caught a wild horse.\n",
[14610]="70037E29\n1\tDefeat Dunlendings at their war-camp\tInvading Dunlendings can be found in their war-camp overlooking the Fords of Isen in the Westfold. You should defeat Dunlending invaders.\n2\tDefeat Dunlendings at their war-camp (total: 8)\tInvading Dunlendings can be found in their war-camp overlooking the Fords of Isen in the Westfold. You should defeat Dunlending invaders.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of Dunlendings at the Fords of Isen, but the true danger marches by the tens of thousands towards Helm's Deep.\n",
[14611]="700372D6\n1\tYou found a Dunlending token upon one of the Warg-rider defilers. You should bring it to Reeve Fríthild\tYou found a Dunlending token upon one of the Warg-riders. You should bring it to Reeve Fríthild.\n2\tBring the Dunlending token to Reeve Fríthild\tReeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke. You should bring the Dunlending token you found to Reeve Fríthild.\n",
[14612]="7001AAD1\n1\tScout the south-east ruins\030Scout the southern ruins\030Explore the south-west ruins\tThe Wild Ruins lie to the south of Ost Galadh. Fuirgam has asked you to keep an eye out for enemies out of Dol Guldur or anything else out of the ordinary in the Wild Ruins.\n2\tTalk to Fuirgam at Ost Galadh\tFuirgam is at Ost Galadh, north of the Wild Ruins. You should report back to Fuirgam with the results of your exploration. In particular, he may be interested in the odd footprints you discovered during your trek.\n",
[14613]="700530C5\n1\tDeliver the calcified carapaces to a collection box\030Collect calcified carapaces (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire calcified carapaces.\n",
[14614]="700530C3\n1\tDeliver the lost essences to a collection box\030Collect lost essences (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire lost essences.\n",
